# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets (deployed with the cf CLI, see deploy/README.md):
# cross-origin isolation for SharedArrayBuffer (multi-threaded WASM solver).
# Keep COOP/COEP in this one rule: a header set by several matching rules is comma-joined,
# which breaks isolation. Checked by deploy/check.mjs.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
